{"version":1,"content":"<p>當地時間周四，全球首富、SpaceX和特斯拉公司創始人埃隆·馬斯克就SpaceX未來可能的價值，<strong>拋出了一個極其瘋狂的天文數字：128000000000000000000美元（換算成中文數量單位是12800京美元）</strong>。這個數字為128後面跟着18個零，相當於1280億個十億，或128萬億個百萬。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588218.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.462211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:08:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:17:22.626534+00:00","content_hash":"3447c79d1dc4e66ddda4afda55c35607a23efadb913a503a4443faca60e8c77e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}